\title "4. Type notes on the staff"
\ts (4 4)
r.1{txt "Staff view. 1. Press N: a caret line and a faint note show at the start of this bar. 2. Type C, D, E, G: four quarter notes, each the nearest of its name, the caret moving on after each. 3. Press 6, =, F: a half note, F sharp (= before a letter is a sharp, 0 a natural). 4. Press Esc, then Both: the tab shows the frets Frets picked."} |
r.1 |

